<title>USA: Paper April Brent mixed in thin late U.S. trading.</title>
<headline>Paper April Brent mixed in thin late U.S. trading.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>North Sea Brent ended mixed in thin late U.S. trading on Thursday, traders said.</p>
<p>Two April Brent partial cargoes moved at $19.29 and $19.33 a barrel, compared to the IPE settlement of $19.32.</p>
<p>March/April traded at 30 cents a barrel, down from earlier talk of 38-42 cents.</p>
<p>April/May changed hands at 27 cents, down from a 33-cent deal earlier in the day.</p>
<p>--Patricia Garip-Bertuol NY Energy Desk ((+1 212 859 1620))</p>
